@startuml class-diagram
title Class diagram (domain) — BrewLite
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

enum UserRole {
  CUSTOMER
  ADMIN
}
enum OrderStatus {
  PENDING
  PAID
  PREPARING
  READY
  COMPLETED
  PAYMENT_FAILED
  CANCELLED
}
enum ProductSize {
  S
  M
  L
}
enum PaymentMethod {
  WALLET
  CARD
}
enum PaymentStatus {
  SUCCESS
  FAILED
}

class User {
  +id : UUID
  +email : String <<unique>>
  -passwordHash : String
  +fullName : String
  +phone : String [0..1]
  +role : UserRole
  +isActive : Boolean
  +loyaltyPoints : Int
  +totalSpent : Int
  +createdAt : DateTime
}
class Product {
  +id : UUID
  +code : String [0..1]
  +name : String
  +description : String
  +category : String
  +price : Int
  +imageUrl : String
  +stock : Int
  +version : Int
  +isAvailable : Boolean
}
class Topping {
  +id : UUID
  +name : String
  +price : Int
  +isAvailable : Boolean
}
class Order {
  +id : UUID
  +orderCode : String <<unique>>
  +status : OrderStatus
  +pickupMethod : String
  +customerNote : String [0..1]
  +subtotal : Int
  +discountAmount : Int
  +pointsUsed : Int
  +pointsDiscountAmount : Int
  +total : Int
  +promotionCode : String [0..1]
  +cancelReason : String [0..1]
  +createdAt : DateTime
}
class OrderItem {
  +id : UUID
  +productName : String
  +size : ProductSize
  +qty : Int
  +sugarLevel : String
  +iceLevel : String
  +itemNote : String [0..1]
  +toppings : Json
  +unitPrice : Int
  +lineTotal : Int
}
class Payment {
  +id : UUID
  +idempotencyKey : String <<unique>>
  +amount : Int
  +method : PaymentMethod
  +status : PaymentStatus
  +transactionRef : String [0..1]
  +errorMessage : String [0..1]
  +createdAt : DateTime
}
class Promotion {
  +id : UUID
  +code : String <<unique>>
  +description : String
  +discountPercent : Int
  +maxDiscountAmount : Int
  +minOrderValue : Int
  +usageLimit : Int
  +usedCount : Int
  +isActive : Boolean
  +expiresAt : DateTime
}
class LoyaltyTransaction {
  +id : UUID
  +points : Int
  +balanceAfter : Int
  +type : String  «EARN | REDEEM»
  +description : String
  +createdAt : DateTime
}

User "1" -down- "0..*" Order : đặt >
User "1" -right- "0..*" LoyaltyTransaction : có >
Order "1" *-down- "1..*" OrderItem : gồm >
Order "1" -down- "0..*" Payment : được thanh toán bằng >
Order "1" -down- "0..*" LoyaltyTransaction : phát sinh >
Order "0..*" -right- "0..1" Promotion : áp dụng (theo mã) >
Product "1" -down- "0..*" OrderItem : được đặt trong <
OrderItem "0..*" .. "0..*" Topping : chọn (toppings) >

User --> UserRole
Order --> OrderStatus
OrderItem --> ProductSize
Payment --> PaymentMethod
Payment --> PaymentStatus

note bottom of Order
  Chuyển trạng thái hợp lệ:
  PENDING → PAID | PAYMENT_FAILED | CANCELLED
  PAYMENT_FAILED → PENDING | PAID | CANCELLED
  PAID → PREPARING | CANCELLED
  PREPARING → READY → COMPLETED
  COMPLETED, CANCELLED: trạng thái kết thúc
end note
note right of Payment
  Mỗi Idempotency-Key chỉ
  tạo tối đa 1 Payment.
end note
@enduml
